flowchart TD
A[Weather fetch requested] --> B[Close old TCP connection<br/>AT+CIPCLOSE]
B --> C[Open TCP to wttr.in:80<br/>AT+CIPSTART]
C --> D{Connection OK?}
D -- No --> Z[Show fetch failed]
D -- Yes --> E[Build HTTP GET request<br/>location + format]
E --> F[Signal payload length<br/>AT+CIPSEND=len]
F --> G{Prompt received > ?}
G -- No --> Z
G -- Yes --> H[Send HTTP request]

H --> I[Wait SEND OK and read UART data]
I --> J[Parse +IPD payload]
J --> K[Strip HTTP headers and CLOSED]
K --> L[Trim text result]
L --> M[Update LVGL label]

M --> N{More fields?}
N -- Yes --> E2[Next format: C, then t, then f]
E2 --> E
N -- No --> O[Set status Done]